module tasks.`2026-11-27-harness-codex-goal`

task HarnessCodexGoal {
  title "Harness: set, show and clear a Codex goal on a seat through the ACP goal extension"
  verify $ make -C crates/bboxy450-harness test-gui
  paths "crates/bboxy450-harness/**", "crates/bbt-mux/**", "crates/bboxy450-term/**"
  brief """
    # Codex goal on a harness seat

    ROLE: EXECUTOR. Operator, 2026-11-27: "use goal to implement all of this".
    Create a goal (Codex create_goal) from the outcome and hold it until the verify command exits 0 and the change is on the harness and term origin/main.

    ## Evidence
    codex-cli 0.169.0 has the stable goals feature. /opt/homebrew/bin/codex-acp implements the ACP extension method _session/goal (actions set, pause, resume, clear; legacy name _codex/session/goal_control) and publishes the current goal (objective, status, tokens and time used) in session info metadata under the key goal. bboxy450-harness has no code for either (git grep -i goal finds nothing outside animation code), so today a goal exists only if the Codex model creates it itself.

    ## Outcome
    - The harness reads the goal a Codex ACP agent publishes and shows it in the seat header (objective, status), in the transcript record (additive IR only) and in seat_get.
    - An Oracle sets, pauses, resumes or clears a seat's goal: one MCP tool (seat_goal) and the composer command /goal. task_delegate sets the delegated task's title and verify command as the goal when the agent supports the extension.
    - An agent without the extension answers one clear unsupported result; nothing hangs.

    ## Proof
    A fixture ACP agent that implements _session/goal; tests for set, publish, clear, restart of the harness with a goal in place, and the unsupported agent. Formal: the goal lifecycle joins the seat model with a broken control. Unattended.

    Land harness first (its make land), then make bump-harness and make land in term. Report with reports/2026-11-27-harness-codex-goal.den.
    """

  managed {
    authorship = json"{\"kind\":\"seat\",\"process_generation\":\"1\",\"public_key\":\"XLMAqZTUlsEIvVxlAso8YDW5Ud3ShPEW3Kz+hD0wm1c=\",\"signer\":\"seat:01M89Z74HN4GSHEPS6TC0H6FDX\"}"
    created = json"\"2026-11-27T17:41:02.603Z\""
    created_by = json"\"seat:01M89Z74HN4GSHEPS6TC0H6FDX\""
    delegated_by = json"\"seat:01M89Z74HN4GSHEPS6TC0H6FDX\""
    id = json"\"01M8F1H99T0GWFV8EG4CBXJNNH\""
    number = json"1794292861628022"
    status = Open
    swarm = json"\"01M7P04CW1T6KY8CMSS6DQM12Q\""
    updated = json"\"2026-11-27T17:41:02.603Z\""
    updated_by = json"\"seat:01M89Z74HN4GSHEPS6TC0H6FDX\""
    provenance = json"{\"digest\":\"sha256:27c14067be89c789d75c2ca15ab1c3b834315ca64f257bc065ae2a6a5d9c821d\",\"frontmatter_digest\":\"sha256:364f4fad89646df229cec64b35cf42d77dd46296bc418a49bd0b24c1e95d772c\",\"signer\":\"seat:01M89Z74HN4GSHEPS6TC0H6FDX\",\"sig\":\"kSnKZ65RYBypoi8dob7WJ6IAcXqJSFaqk3vgq5VbdEKtMQKK6oeV4SUtEEKMqrmF7L/kj5DgGR7XuL1n2caWAw==\",\"log\":\"bboxy://activity/index-93ad8c65834c983167272adcebd708d5016d7d1135673e1090720e78289f698a/2358\",\"event\":{\"id\":\"01M8F1HAMNAAS5QRVTFV9YGAAF\",\"sequence\":2358,\"hash\":\"d4e4462207bbd3a43bef9856fd06f004611dc943dde5f68eee89be0a85eca510\"}}"
